<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today. US$1.00 COSTS    1.3734/39  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7608/13  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9850/55  Dutch Guilders</p>
